      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Dc χMT at 300 K is 42.63 cm3 K mol−1 (three uncoupled DyIII); it falls to 21.19 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K. Magnetization reaches 17.7 μB at 1.9 K and 70 kOe and is anisotropic. Slim butterfly hysteresis is seen at 1.9 K without remanence or coercivity. Zero-field ac data show SMM-like slow relaxation with two processes (χ″ peaks near 10 and 570 Hz at 1.9 K). Arrhenius barriers are Ueff = 4.4 K (τ0 = 4.4×10−5 s, fast) and 8.9 K (τ0 = 8.9×10−5 s, slow); FR becomes temperature-independent below 3 K with τQTM = 2×10−4 s.",
